      "incident_updates": [
        {
          "id": "dz5mt91668p1",
          "status": "identified",
          "body": "This issue is caused by a Microsoft 365 service incident, and mail, calendar and search tools in the Microsoft 365 connector are still failing for most requests. Claude for Outlook remains affected. You can follow Microsoft's progress at https://status.cloud.microsoft. We will update this post when service is restored.",
